processor.UpdateOrderHistory(order);
```

**Risk:** 7 distinct production methods — failure could stem from any; diagnosis is costly.  
**Fix:** Test each method in isolation; if you need an integration test, mark it explicitly:

```csharp
[TestMethod]
[TestCategory("Integration")]
public void OrderProcessor_FullWorkflow_Succeeds() { ... }
```

