### LOW

#### 9. General Fixture (Over-broad Setup) — class-level (line 11, 19)

```csharp
private FakeLogger _logger = null!;
// initialized in Setup() but used by 0 of 9 test methods
```

**Risk:** Every test pays the cost of constructing `_logger` for nothing; readers assume it matters.  
**Fix:** Remove from `[TestInitialize]`; inject only where needed.

