### EXTENDED CATALOG — Assertion Roulette

#### 10 (bonus). Assertion Roulette — `CalculateTotal_ReturnsCorrectAmount` (line 70)

```csharp
Assert.AreEqual(247.50m, order.TotalAmount);
Assert.AreEqual(22.28m, order.TaxAmount);
Assert.AreEqual(269.78m, order.GrandTotal);
```

Three assertions with **no message parameter** — if one fails, the stack trace shows only "expected 269.78 but got …" with no label.  
**Fix:** Add messages: `Assert.AreEqual(247.50m, order.TotalAmount, "Subtotal mismatch");`

