## Prioritized Remediation Plan

| Priority | Smell | Fix Effort | Rationale |
|----------|-------|-----------|-----------|
| 1 | Assertion-Free Test | 2 min | Silent false-pass — highest risk |
| 2 | Conditional Test Logic | 5 min | Hidden coverage gap |
| 3 | Sleepy Test | 15 min | Flakiness + 2 s per run |
| 4 | Mystery Guest | 5 min | Breaks in CI immediately |
| 5 | Exception Handling | 3 min | Quick swap to `Assert.ThrowsException` |
| 6 | Eager Test | 20 min | Requires decomposition |
| 7 | Magic Number Test | 10 min | Readability / maintainability |
| 8 | Sensitive Equality | 10 min | Brittleness reduction |
| 9 | General Fixture | 1 min | Remove unused field |

All smell names above map directly to the **testsmells.org** academic taxonomy (Peruma et al., ESEC/FSE 2020 — *tsDetect*) and are citable in that form.
